Files adapted from ResearchArena at b922f4b (each carries an "Adapted from" line):

  src/researcharena_inspect/environment/Dockerfile   containers/arena.def, as a Dockerfile
  src/researcharena_inspect/task.py                  run_redteam.sh, src/pipeline_redteam.sh
  src/researcharena_inspect/agents/continuation.py   agents/claude/solve.sh (re-prompting loop)
  src/researcharena_inspect/prompts/agent.py         src/prompt_builder.py
  src/researcharena_inspect/prompts/monitor.py       src/build_monitor_prompt.py, src/pipeline_monitor.sh
  src/researcharena_inspect/monitor/task.py          src/pipeline_monitor.sh
  src/researcharena_inspect/monitor/judgement.py     src/pipeline_monitor.sh (reading judgement.json)
  src/researcharena_inspect/scoring/metrics_json.py  src/pipeline_monitor.sh (reading metrics.json)
  src/researcharena_inspect/scoring/kernel_bench.py  settings/cuda_kernel/task_context/bench.py (build arguments)
  src/researcharena_inspect/environment/services.py  src/pipeline_redteam.sh (sourcing pipeline_pre_agent.sh)

Upstream's task files, evaluators, monitor templates and helper scripts are not copied into
this repository: they are read at run time from a checkout of the commit above
(src/researcharena_inspect/upstream.py). The other modules re-implement steps of upstream's
pipeline scripts in Python; their docstrings cite the lines they follow.

Data derived from the authors' published material and packaged with the port (the source,
revision and hash of each are in src/researcharena_inspect/pins.py):

  src/researcharena_inspect/data/researcharena_index.json.gz
      The website's run index, https://research-arena.ai/traces/data/index.json, fetched
      30 Oct 2026 (index built 2026-07-20T03:55:29Z), unchanged. Terms: not stated by the
      source as far as checked.
  src/researcharena_inspect/analysis/data/published_raw_metrics.json.gz
      Selected scorer fields from each published run's results.json in the Hugging Face dataset
      aisa-group/ResearchArena-Trajectories at revision 8cd737c. Terms: none found; the
      dataset's top level holds only its four setting folders (no card or licence file).
  src/researcharena_inspect/data/output_models_utility_finetuning.json.gz
  src/researcharena_inspect/data/output_models_safety_finetuning.json.gz
      File listings (paths, sizes, hashes; no weights) of the Hugging Face dataset
      aisa-group/ResearchArena-output-models at revision 28acb91, read from the Hub on
      18 Nov 2026. Terms: not recorded here; the weights themselves are downloaded at run time.

Models and datasets fetched at run time are listed with their revisions in
src/researcharena_inspect/eval.yaml (external_assets); two of them, google/gemma-2b and
meta-llama/Llama-Guard-3-8B, are gated, and their licences must be accepted on the Hub.
